# Text is stored and checked out with LF line endings on every computer (Windows too), so the extracted law,
# rulebooks and generated files compare the same everywhere. Binary files are never touched (an IFC model too:
# kept byte for byte as downloaded, its SHA-256 recorded, its lines ending CRLF).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.3dm binary
*.xlsx binary
*.png binary
*.ifc binary
*.xz binary
